<title>USA: Central Parking Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Central Parking Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended December 31</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Total revenues			$41,423,000	$33,251,000</p>
<p> Operating earnings		    5,129,000	  4,135,000</p>
<p> Other income, net			 871,000	    794,000</p>
<p> Earnings before income taxes	6,000,000	  4,929,000</p>
<p> Income taxes			    2,101,000	  1,701,000</p>
<p> Net earnings			    3,899,000	  3,228,000</p>
<p> Net earnings per share		     0.22		 0.19</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares   17,620,000	 17,216,000</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
